# LESSON 3: agents.  "mock" is a pretend AI that needs no key, so you can learn first.

agent buddy:
    model "mock"
    role "You are a friendly assistant."

say ask buddy "hello there"
say ask buddy "do you remember me?"

# Swap the model line for a real one when you have a key in a .env file:
#     model "gemini/gemini-2.5-flash"
# and the same program talks to a real AI.

# YOUR TURN
# 1. Make a second agent called "pal" and ask it something.
# 2. Put the question in a variable:   set q to "hi"   then   ask buddy q
# 3. Ask both agents at once:   say ask_all([buddy, pal], "hi")
